    "sourceUrl": "https://www.techpowerup.com/354747/amd-advances-built-in-protection-from-physical-attacks-for-security-critical-systems",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-12",
    "summary": "Combined with embedded CPUs, AI Engines and programmable logic, Versal TR devices help customers strengthen the protection of security-critical information without compromising system performance, size, weight, power or time to market. From data center networking and fintech applications to defense systems and critical industrial infrastructure, customers seeking higher levels of device security today typically build custom solutions in-house using mechanical enclosures, ASICs and other components, adding development cost, specialist resources, verification effort and re-spin risk. This reduces the need for separate compute, security and enclosure-based protection components. This approach can save board area and simplify board design versus custom solutions while giving customers access to AMD tools, technical support and a broad partner ecosystem.",
    "whyItMatters": "立讯需要把重点放在整机柜、供电、散热、高速线缆和连接器，而不是只看 GPU 或服务器品牌。",
